					<meta name="Description" content="Ski Lines is a minimalist strategy game about designing a ski resort map. Draw pistes, build lifts, and connect mountain landmarks as new points of interest appear. Spend your limited resources wisely, adapt your network each day, and keep the resort moving for as long as possible.">
			
