																								<script type="text/javascript">
							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"714542561332560788","clan_steamid":"103582791475777461","event_name":"10,000 Wishlists! The Mountain Is Yours!","event_type":35,"appid":4854120,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1793315520,"rtime32_end_time":1793320201,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"Grand Tourmalet's 2,000-point limit is lifted until release!\",null,\"La limite de 2 000 points sur Grand Tourmalet est lev\u00e9e jusqu'\u00e0 la sortie du jeu !\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"10,000 wishlists, over 13,000 demo players, and a little surprise for everyone who wanted to keep skiing!\",null,\"10 000 wishlists, plus de 13 000 joueurs sur la d\u00e9mo\u2026 et une petite surprise pour ceux qui en redemandent !\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"f7b5076c37d1f82e19edbd097c6b2bd19c1f2b54.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"c26dc9eb216285871660f62ce645d1b2a37af576.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"library_spotlight\":true}","announcement_body":{"gid":"714542561332560789","clanid":"46256053","posterid":"0","headline":"10,000 Wishlists! The Mountain Is Yours!","posttime":1793315558,"updatetime":1793315558,"body":"[p][b]10,000 wishlists. Over 13,000 demo players.[\/b][\/p][p]I honestly didn't expect things to escalate quite this quickly.[\/p][p]What started as a little indie game about drawing lines on snowy mountains has turned into something much bigger than I ever imagined.[\/p][p]And judging by the amount of feedback I've received, some of you have become... [i]a little too addicted[\/i] to those lines. \ud83d\ude05[\/p][p]First of all, [b]THANK YOU![\/b] \u2764\ufe0f[\/p][p]To everyone who played the demo, shared the game, reported bugs, suggested improvements, or simply added Ski Lines to their wishlist: you've made the past few days absolutely incredible.[\/p][p][\/p][h2]Please sir, may I have some more?[\/h2][p][\/p][p]There's one piece of feedback I've been hearing a LOT:[\/p][p][b]\"WHY DOES THE DEMO STOP AT 2,000 POINTS? I WANT TO KEEP PLAYING!\"[\/b][\/p][p]Fair enough. \ud83d\ude05[\/p][p]And with some of you replaying Ski Dubai over and over, pushing the game to its absolute limits (and nearly breaking it), that shopping mall was starting to get a little crowded anyway![\/p][p]The 2,000-point limit on Grand Tourmalet was originally there to save some of the fun for the full release. But with so many of you asking for just one more run (and then another, and another...), I figured you deserved a little something.[\/p][p]So, to celebrate 10,000 wishlists...[\/p][p][\/p][h2]\ud83c\udf89 The 2,000-point limit on Grand Tourmalet is GONE![\/h2][p][\/p][p][b]Starting now, and until the full game's release, you can keep playing Grand Tourmalet beyond 2,000 points![\/b][\/p][p]Keep expanding your resort, optimizing your network, chasing higher scores, and creating increasingly questionable ski lift configurations.[\/p][p]The rest of the demo remains unchanged, but at least you won't have to say goodbye to your mountain just as things start getting interesting.[\/p][p]Consider it a small thank-you for all the incredible support.[\/p][p][\/p][h2]Back to work! \u26f7\ufe0f[\/h2][p][\/p][p]Meanwhile, I'm still working hard on the full release, fixing bugs, polishing existing features, and bringing the remaining mountains to life.[\/p][p]There's still plenty to do before launch, and your feedback has been invaluable in making Ski Lines better.[\/p][p][b]Thank you again for 10,000 wishlists![\/b] It's an incredible milestone for a solo developer, and I couldn't have reached it without you.[\/p][p]Now, if you'll excuse me, I have a game to finish.[\/p][p][b]You have some skiing to do.[\/b] \ud83c\udfbf[\/p]","commentcount":6,"tags":["workshop","mod_reviewed","ModAct_1447510170_1793315937_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"570427373261112381","event_gid":"714542561332560788","voteupcount":27,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"570427373261112381","rtime32_last_modified":1793414842,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1793315938,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1793275283,"votes_up":27,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"585057095914763845","gidfeature2":"570427373261112381"},{"gid":"714542561332560390","clan_steamid":"103582791475777461","event_name":"Patch 0.2.4: Sharper Views, Smoother Connections","event_type":13,"appid":4854120,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1793230200,"rtime32_end_time":1793235601,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"Improved connections, precise upgrade tools, sharper visuals, smoother controls, and a preview of Perisher's scenery\",null,\"Des connexions am\u00e9lior\u00e9es, un outil d'am\u00e9lioration plus pr\u00e9cis, de nouvelles options graphiques et un aper\u00e7u de Perisher\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"Better snapping, more precise upgrades, new graphics options, smoother controls, and a sneak peek at Perisher!\",null,\"Le patch 0.2.4 am\u00e9liore les connexions, la pr\u00e9cision des outils, les options graphiques et les contr\u00f4les, tout en d\u00e9voilant les d\u00e9cors de Perisher.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"03f99a0184b081eb02294f467917661f0f4fb3f7.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"74d10be643616555f4927dd12cf2caa11e771bb3.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"library_spotlight\":true}","announcement_body":{"gid":"714542561332560391","clanid":"46256053","posterid":"0","headline":"Patch 0.2.4: Sharper Views, Smoother Connections","posttime":1793230206,"updatetime":1793230206,"body":"[p][i]Better graphics options, improved snapping, more precise upgrades, and a little trip to Australia![\/i][\/p][p]Patch 0.2.4 is here! This update focuses on making Ski Lines look better, feel smoother, and behave a little more predictably. And while we're at it, here's a sneak peek at what's happening beyond the demo.[\/p][p][\/p][h3]\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Perisher is taking shape![\/h3][p][\/p][p]Work continues on [b]Perisher, Australia[\/b], one of the mountains coming to the full game![\/p][p]Its scenery is getting some love, with new rocky formations and environmental details to give the mountain its own personality.[\/p][p][b]Perisher isn't available in the demo[\/b], but I wanted to share a little progress from behind the scenes![\/p][p][\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46256053\/2fecc8ab4870af409e437e91d78470f0e6b7211d.png\"][\/img][\/p][h3]\ud83d\udd17 Better slope & lift connections[\/h3][p][\/p][p]Connecting slopes and lifts to points of interest (POIs) should now feel much more natural.[\/p][p]I've improved the snapping behavior to make building your ski resort a little less fiddly, especially when working around existing connections.[\/p][p][\/p][h3]\ud83c\udfaf More precise upgrades[\/h3][p][\/p][p]The upgrade tool is now better at selecting exactly what you want![\/p][p]Previously, upgrading a slope running beneath a lift or a snow cannon placed too close to a POI could be tricky, or sometimes impossible.[\/p][p]These situations should now be much easier to handle![\/p][p][\/p][h3]\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f More graphics options![\/h3][p][\/p][p]A few long-requested graphics settings have made their way into the game:[\/p][list][*][p][b]VSync[\/b] can now be enabled or disabled.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]FXAA and SMAA[\/b] anti-aliasing options are now available.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Render scale[\/b] can now go all the way up to [b]200%[\/b], for those who like their mountains extra crispy.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46256053\/0a18fa2bc1cfd5202f135735620a7df80b6d2f5e.png\"][\/img][\/p][h3]\u2328\ufe0f Keyboard controls improvements[\/h3][p][\/p][p]A few changes to make navigating the mountain easier:[\/p][list][*][p][b]Page Up \/ Page Down[\/b] can now be used to zoom.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Q \/ E[\/b] (QWERTY) now control time deceleration and acceleration, replacing Ctrl \/ Shift.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Hold [b]Shift[\/b] while using the arrow keys or Page Up \/ Page Down to pan and zoom faster.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][\/p][h3]\ud83d\udc1b Bug fixes[\/h3][list][*][p][b]Improved FPS![\/b] Fixed a CPU bottleneck caused by UI controls repeatedly searching through all loaded objects for windows that didn't exist. Turns out looking for nothing can be surprisingly expensive![\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed the drawing animation in the slope help popup.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][\/p][hr][\/hr][p]With the full release getting closer, these final improvements are making a real difference. Thank you for all the feedback and support throughout the demo![\/p][p]See you on the slopes! \u26f7\ufe0f[\/p]","commentcount":3,"tags":["workshop","mod_reviewed","ModAct_803139239_1793231409_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"570427373261013923","event_gid":"714542561332560390","voteupcount":9,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"570427373261013923","rtime32_last_modified":1793317358,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1793231409,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":26284118,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1793223485,"votes_up":9,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"585057095914763845","gidfeature2":"570427373261013923"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["714542561332560789","714542561332560391"],"last_update_event":{"rtime":1793230200,"event_gid":"714542561332560390","announcement_gid":"714542561332560391","clan_account_id":46256053}}};
						</script>
					

					<div data-featuretarget="events-row"></div>
				
								
				
				


								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Ski Lines is a minimalist strategy simulation game about designing a ski resort map.</strong></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Draw ski runs, build lifts, and connect mountain landmarks as new points of interest appear across the slopes. Every day, more skiers arrive, new destinations open, and your resort becomes harder to keep flowing.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Your goal is simple: keep skiers moving.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854120/extras/f62eff769c236b297bcaed9c8a438529.avif?t=1792599201" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Start with a small mountain and a handful of resources. Connect stations, summits, viewpoints, restaurants, refuges, and rescue points with the right mix of pistes and lifts. Easy runs are flexible, harder runs are more demanding, and every new connection changes the shape of your network.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854120/extras/fcb91c033e59bb51df0de255ddc5d735.poster.avif?t=1792599201" width=1170 height=266 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854120/extras/fcb91c033e59bb51df0de255ddc5d735.webm?t=1792599201" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854120/extras/fcb91c033e59bb51df0de255ddc5d735.mp4?t=1792599201" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >But the mountain is not just a blank canvas. Snow cannons let you expand the skiable area, while tree clearing allows you to open new routes through the forest. Upgrade your lifts, improve your tools, and choose carefully where to invest your limited resources.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854120/extras/f01f1cad22b17e3dae1a4422d9562d36.poster.avif?t=1792599201" width=1170 height=266 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854120/extras/f01f1cad22b17e3dae1a4422d9562d36.webm?t=1792599201" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854120/extras/f01f1cad22b17e3dae1a4422d9562d36.mp4?t=1792599201" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >As the days pass, the resort grows busier. New points of interest appear, skiers demand better routes, and bottlenecks begin to form. Redesign your network, extend the domain, and adapt before the slopes become overwhelmed.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854120/extras/28c09cf1d27c5dac2799558203b5db64.poster.avif?t=1792599201" width=1170 height=266 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854120/extras/28c09cf1d27c5dac2799558203b5db64.webm?t=1792599201" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854120/extras/28c09cf1d27c5dac2799558203b5db64.mp4?t=1792599201" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Key Features</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Draw ski pistes directly on a stylized trail map.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Build lifts to bring skiers back up the mountain.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Connect stations, summits, restaurants, refuges, viewpoints, and more.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Use snow cannons to expand the skiable area.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Clear trees to open new routes through forests.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Upgrade lifts, snow cannons, and other tools as your resort grows.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Manage limited resources and choose your expansions wisely.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Adapt your network as new points of interest appear each day.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Play across famous ski regions inspired by resorts around the world.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Enjoy replayable runs with roguelike progression and evolving mountain layouts.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Level editor &amp; Community maps</p></li></ul>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					Ski Lines is a solo-developed indie game created with the help of generative AI tools. AI was used throughout production to support artwork creation, music and sound design, code assistance, prototyping, iteration, and marketing assets.<br />
<br />
Every AI-assisted element was curated, edited, and integrated by the developer to fit the game’s minimalist ski-map aesthetic and gameplay vision. The use of AI helped accelerate production while preserving human creative direction, design decisions, quality control, and final authorship.				</i>
			</p>
